# Project Architecture Rules

## Stack

- **Framework**: React 19 + Vite
- **Language**: TypeScript (strict mode)
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS v4 + shadcn/ui
- **Data Fetching**: TanStack React Query v5
- **Forms**: React Hook Form + Zod
- **Routing**: TanStack Router (file-based)
- **Global State**: Zustand
- **Toasts**: Sonner
- **Icons**: Lucide React

---

## Folder Structure

```
src/
├── assets/
│   ├── images/
│   └── fonts/
│
├── components/
│   ├── ui/                               # shadcn generated — NEVER edit manually
│   │   └── <component-name>.tsx
│   ├── shared/                           # Generic UI, zero domain knowledge
│   │   └── <component-name>.tsx
│   └── skeletons/
│       ├── shared/                       # Base skeleton building blocks
│       │   └── <component-name>.skeleton.tsx
│       └── <feature-name>/               # Feature skeletons
│           └── <component-name>.skeleton.tsx
│
├── features/                             # Everything belonging to a feature domain
│   └── <feature-name>/                   # Grouped by domain regardless of reuse count
│       ├── components/                   # Feature-specific components
│       ├── hooks/                        # Feature-specific hooks
│       ├── schemas/                      # Zod schemas for this feature
│       ├── services/                     # API calls for this feature
│       └── types/                        # Feature-specific TypeScript types
│
├── hooks/                                # Shared hooks used across features
│   └── <hook-name>.ts
│
├── layouts/                              # Layout shell components
│   └── <layout-name>-layout.tsx
│
├── routes/                               # TanStack Router file-based routes
│   ├── __root.tsx                        # Root route
│   ├── index.tsx                         # Home /
│   └── <route-name>/
│       └── <page-name>.tsx
│
├── services/                             # Global API service functions (shared)
│   └── <feature-name>.service.ts
│
├── store/                                # Zustand global state stores
│   └── <feature-name>.store.ts
│
├── types/                                # Global TypeScript types
│   └── <feature-name>.d.ts
│
├── utils/                                # Shared utility functions
│   ├── app-errors.ts                     # AppError class
│   └── catch-error.ts                    # catchError utility
│
└── config/                               # App configuration & env
    └── env.ts
```

