## Naming Conventions

| Type | Convention | Example |
|---|---|---|
| Route files | kebab-case | `forgot-password.tsx` |
| Components | PascalCase | `ProductCard.tsx` |
| Hooks | camelCase + `use` prefix | `useProducts.ts` |
| Schemas | camelCase + `Schema` suffix | `loginSchema` |
| Services | camelCase + feature | `auth.service.ts` |
| Store files | camelCase + `.store.ts` | `auth.store.ts` |
| Constants | SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE | `JSON_HEADER`, `API_URL` |
| Types files | camelCase + `.d.ts` | `product.d.ts` |
| Skeleton files | end in `.skeleton.tsx` | `product-card.skeleton.tsx` |
| Feature folders | always plural | `products/`, `categories/` |

